   aboutExam:'The Claude Certified Associate - Foundations (CCAO-F) certification validates that you can use Claude effectively as a core productivity tool in a business role. It targets analysts, project managers, operations leads and people in marketing, communications, HR and education who work in claude.ai: turning business objectives into well-specified requests, checking and adapting output before it is used, choosing the right capability, model and context strategy, building repeatable workflows with Projects, Skills and connectors, and applying data-protection and responsible-use judgment.',
